{"meta":{"ph":"steə(r); NAmE ster","pos":"verb","stars":"★★"},"defs":[{"def":"to be obvious or easy to see 明摆着；显而易见","ex":[{"s":"That evening, she sat in her room, staring into space.","src":"2026北京卷·完形填空","cat":"gaokao","year":2026,"t":"当晚,她坐在房间里,凝视着太空."},{"s":"One August afternoon, I sat in my kitchen staring at a glass vase that hadn’t seen daylight since my wedding.","src":"2025新高考I卷·完形填空","cat":"gaokao","year":2025,"t":"八月的一个下午，我坐在厨房里，盯着一只自婚礼以来就没再见天日的玻璃花瓶。"},{"s":"Kevin stared at the man at their front door.","src":"2025浙江1月卷·读后续写","cat":"gaokao","year":2025,"t":"凯文盯着前门那个男人。"},{"s":"Staring at the bookcases in my study, packed with so many great books that had remained unread, I heard a loud voice in my head — “Shame on you!","src":"2024天津3月卷·阅读Passage 2","cat":"gaokao","year":2024,"t":"盯着书房里塞满那么多始终未读的好书的书架，我脑海中响起一个响亮的声音——\"你真丢脸！\""},{"s":"I just stared at it and started to ___8___.","src":"2024北京卷","cat":"gaokao","year":2024,"t":"我只是盯着它开____8____始。"},{"s":"For almost a year I struggled on, constantly staring at this wall that faced me.","src":"2022北京卷·阅读理解B","cat":"gaokao","year":2022,"t":"差不多一年，我都在挣扎，不停地盯着面前这堵墙。"},{"s":"I can’t just sit there and stare at a TV all day.","src":"2022天津4月卷","cat":"gaokao","year":2022,"t":"我不能只是坐在那里整天盯着电视。"},{"s":"However, what my children want to do after school is pick up a screen — any screen — and stare at it for hours.","src":"2021浙江6月卷·阅读理解B","cat":"gaokao","year":2021,"t":"然而，我的孩子们放学后想做的，是拿起一块屏幕——任何屏幕——然后盯着它看上几个小时。"},{"s":"As the night wore on，people began to close their eyes，but the seats were so uncomfortable that only a very heavy sleeper could manage to get any____3____．The woman looked over at the man．He was still staring at her．She looked back at him with fire in her eyes．I was beginning to get____4____，too．","src":"2021北京卷·完形填空","cat":"gaokao","year":2021,"t":"夜深了人们开始闭上眼睛但座位很不舒服只有睡得很沉的人才能____3____睡着．那位女士看向男士．他还在盯着她看．她用愤怒的眼神回望他．我也开始变得____4____不安了．"},{"s":"A son of immigrants, Chris stared learning English a little over three years ago.","src":"2019全国I卷·阅读理解B","cat":"gaokao","year":2019,"t":"作为移民之子，克里斯三年多前才开始学英语。"},{"s":"The museum was free． We entered， excited． A group of people sitting in the hall stopped talking and stared at us．","src":"2018天津卷·阅读理解B","cat":"gaokao","year":2018,"t":"博物馆免费。我们兴奋地走进去。大厅里坐着的一群人停下交谈，盯着我们看。"},{"s":"（3）How did the author feel about being stared at by the people in the hall？","src":"2018天津卷·阅读理解B","cat":"gaokao","year":2018,"t":"（2）作者对被大厅里的人盯着看有什么感受？"},{"s":"A comprehensive study of 4, 500 children conducted by the National Institutes of Health in 2018 shows that children who spent more than seven hours a day staring at screens showed evidence of premature thinning of their brain's cortex-the outer layer that processes sensory information.","src":"2018上海卷·Section A","cat":"gaokao","year":2018,"t":"美国国立卫生研究院2018年对4500名儿童开展的一项综合研究表明，每天盯着屏幕超过7小时的儿童，其大脑皮层（处理感官信息的外层）出现过早变薄的证据。"},{"s":"With water falling off it thick, brown hair, the bear stared back at me.","src":"外研社B1 U5","cat":"waiyan","t":"水从它浓密棕色的毛发上滴落，那头熊回瞪着我。"},{"s":"People would stare at me because I was “big” and I hated the way I looked.","src":"外研社B6 U1","cat":"waiyan","t":"人们会盯着我看 因为我是\"大\",我讨厌我的样子。"},{"s":"They stared back, their blank faces giving no clue as to what they would say next.","src":"外研社B7 U4","cat":"waiyan","t":"他们盯着后面看 他们的空白面 根本不知道他们接下来会说什么"},{"s":"They stared back and their faces showed no clue that could help her know what they were going to say next.","src":"外研社B7 U6","cat":"waiyan","t":"他们盯着后面看 他们的脸没有显示任何线索 可以帮助她知道他们接下来会说什么"},{"s":"REFLECTING crucial perceive lack component demonstrate interact stare at embarrassment UNIT 4 BODY LANGUAGE UNIT 4 BODY LANGUAGE 1 In groups, brainstorm a list of different kinds of body language.","src":"人教选必1 U4","cat":"renjiao","t":"更新关键感知缺失部分显示互动凝视尴尬 UNIT 4机构语言 UNIT 4机构语言 1 群集,集思广益 不同种类的肢体语言列表."}]},{"def":"to be certain to happen 必定发生","ex":[]}]}